WEBVTT

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:17.300
(Look at the horizon... Start to run...)

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.400
Tierra abierta
(Open land)

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.500
Polvo al viento
(Dust in the wind)

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.400
Cada músculo
(Every muscle)

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.400
Yo lo siento
(I feel it)

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.400
Corazón late
(Heart beats)

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.500
Como un tambor
(Like a drum)

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:47.500
Dejando atrás
(Leaving behind)

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.600
Todo el temor
(All the fear)

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:51.800
Sin riendas
(Without reins)

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.100
Nadie me puede
(Nobody can)

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:03.400
¡Galopa fuerte!

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:07.000
Galopa fuerte
(Gallop strong Shake the earth)

00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:10.900
Desde el momento!
(From the moment Of my birth)

00:01:11.350 --> 00:01:15.000
Cruzando el valle!
(Crossing the valley Run so fast)

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.700
Haciendo que este!
(Making this Moment last)

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:52.200
Crin al viento
(Mane in the wind)

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:54.100
Fuerza pura
(Pure strength)

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.000
Esta es mi
(This is my)

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.700
Locura
(Madness)

00:01:58.200 --> 00:02:00.100
Relincho fuerte
(Loud neigh)

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:02.300
Al cielo gris
(To the grey sky)

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.200
En este mundo
(In this world)

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:05.900
Soy feliz
(I am happy)

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.400
Sin riendas
(Without reins)

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.900
Nadie me puede
(Nobody can)

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:19.400
¡Galopa fuerte!

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.000
Galopa fuerte
(Gallop strong Shake the earth)

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:27.000
Desde el momento!
(From the moment! Of my birth)

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:07.600
Libre.
(Free.)

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.600
Libre.
(Free.)

00:03:10.400 --> 00:03:10.900
Libre.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:11.500
Libre.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:12.800
Libre.
